WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:01.434 align:start size:94% position:6%
-The big story here --
the International

00:00:01.434 --> 00:00:02.769
Olympic Committee just announced
that it has banned Russia

00:00:02.769 --> 00:00:06.106 align:start size:94% position:6%
from competing
in the 2018 Winter Olympics

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.308 line:92%
because of doping violations.

00:00:08.308 --> 00:00:10.377 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Audience "Oohs" ]

00:00:10.377 --> 00:00:12.545 align:start size:94% position:6%
Or as Putin put it,
"Hello, Donald.

00:00:12.545 --> 00:00:14.114 line:92%
Is time to return favor."

00:00:14.114 --> 00:00:15.081 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:15.081 --> 00:00:19.252 size:84% position:42% line:92%
"Yes, let's get going."

00:00:19.252 --> 00:00:22.522 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's right -- Russia
was banned from the Olympics.

00:00:22.522 --> 00:00:23.189 size:88% position:44% line:92%
But Russia doesn't mind.

00:00:23.189 --> 00:00:25.091 size:88% position:44%
They said they'll just
invade some other teams.

00:00:25.091 --> 00:00:28.495 align:start size:94% position:6%
They don't care.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:00:28.495 --> 00:00:29.329 size:81% position:41% line:92%
It's very interesting.

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.531 size:81% position:41%
Athletes from Russia
can still participate,

00:00:31.531 --> 00:00:35.035
but they won't get credit
for winning any medals.

00:00:35.035 --> 00:00:36.936 size:75% position:38%
Yeah, Olympic events
that don't matter,

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:38.705 align:start size:94% position:6%
or as most people call it,
curling.

00:00:38.705 --> 00:00:39.806 align:start size:94% position:6%
Hey!
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.806 --> 00:00:40.640 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey!
-Hey!

00:00:40.640 --> 00:00:41.708 align:start size:94% position:6%
-What?
-Wait a second.

00:00:41.708 --> 00:00:43.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Curling?
-I like curling.

00:00:43.476 --> 00:00:44.944 align:start size:94% position:6%
I love curling.
-You love it?

00:00:44.944 --> 00:00:47.614
-I think that might be my sport.
[ Laughter ]

00:00:47.614 --> 00:00:49.549 align:start size:94% position:6%
It's where you throw the --
you throw the --

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.984 align:start size:94% position:6%
There's a name for it.
-Stone.

00:00:50.984 --> 00:00:52.485 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Stone?
Is that right?

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:53.053 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-I think so.

00:00:53.053 --> 00:00:54.187 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think they call it
a curling stone.

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.489 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I don't know how they came up
with that name, but...

00:00:56.489 --> 00:00:57.123 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:57.123 --> 00:00:59.159 align:start size:94% position:6%
Throw the stone down,
and then --

00:00:59.159 --> 00:01:00.860 line:92%
-Dudes in front of it brush it.

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.729 line:92%
-They brush it, and, uh, yeah.

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:04.431 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Everybody wins.
-It's a great thing.

00:01:04.431 --> 00:01:06.433 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
I'm in, I'm in.

00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:07.467 align:start size:94% position:6%
U.S.A., baby!
-Yeah.

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:08.802
-Let's go! Let's take it!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:08.802 --> 00:01:11.438 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Curling!
-Curling, this is the year!

00:01:11.438 --> 00:01:13.506 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is the year, baby.
-Let's go U.S.A.!

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.074 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Let's focus!

00:01:14.074 --> 00:01:18.244 align:start size:94% position:6%
Curling is what we want
to take the gold this year.

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
Guys, some news
out of Washington --

00:01:19.446 --> 00:01:22.582
Robert Mueller issued a subpoena
to Deutsche Bank

00:01:22.582 --> 00:01:25.151 align:start size:94% position:6%
for documents
on its relationship

00:01:25.151 --> 00:01:27.020 size:78% position:39% line:92%
with President Trump.

00:01:27.020 --> 00:01:27.787 line:92%
Trump couldn't believe it.

00:01:27.787 --> 00:01:30.457
He said, "I thought it was
pronounced Douche Bank."

00:01:30.457 --> 00:01:33.159 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:33.159 --> 00:01:35.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
"It was funny.
That's why I joined."

00:01:35.295 --> 00:01:40.600 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.237
"I've been a proud card-carrying
Douche since 1987."

00:01:44.237 --> 00:01:46.172 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:46.172 --> 00:01:48.108 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:48.108 --> 00:01:49.409 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Deutsche!

00:01:49.409 --> 00:01:50.543 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Deutsche!

00:01:50.543 --> 00:01:52.879 align:start size:94% position:6%
-But today at the White House,
Trump was talking about

00:01:52.879 --> 00:01:55.815
the House and Senate
coming together on the tax bill,

00:01:55.815 --> 00:01:58.418 align:start size:94% position:6%
and he used a very interesting
word to describe it.

00:01:58.418 --> 00:01:59.018 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Listen to this.

00:01:59.018 --> 00:02:01.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We had a choice.
We could've gone directly

00:02:01.387 --> 00:02:02.789 align:start size:94% position:6%
for a vote,
and we decided that

00:02:02.789 --> 00:02:05.291
let's put it into the conference
and let's come out

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:08.928 align:start size:94% position:6%
with something
where everything is perfecto.

00:02:08.928 --> 00:02:13.299 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:16.669 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Looks like that Rosetta Stone
is finally paying off.

00:02:16.669 --> 00:02:17.937 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:17.937 --> 00:02:19.839 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Perfecto!

00:02:19.839 --> 00:02:23.977 align:start size:94% position:6%
"We should all go to the
biblioteca to read about it."

00:02:23.977 --> 00:02:25.879 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.879 --> 00:02:27.213 line:92%
Oh, here's another big story.

00:02:27.213 --> 00:02:28.548 line:92%
Trump is now fully endorsing

00:02:28.548 --> 00:02:30.783 align:start size:94% position:6%
Alabama Senate candidate
Roy Moore

00:02:30.783 --> 00:02:32.285 align:start size:94% position:6%
even though
there are allegations

00:02:32.285 --> 00:02:34.287 line:92%
that he harassed underage girls.

00:02:34.287 --> 00:02:35.822 align:start size:94% position:6%
'Course, a lot of people
are up in arms,

00:02:35.822 --> 00:02:37.357 align:start size:94% position:6%
and joining us now
to talk about it

00:02:37.357 --> 00:02:39.893 align:start size:94% position:6%
is the candidate himself,
Roy Moore.

00:02:39.893 --> 00:02:40.994 line:92%
Thank you for joining us, Roy.

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:42.662 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:42.662 --> 00:02:45.832 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hey.

00:02:45.832 --> 00:02:49.869
Thank you for letting me do this
via satellite there, Jimmy.

00:02:49.869 --> 00:02:53.840
I'm not allowed anywhere near
the Rockefeller Christmas tree.

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:54.741 size:78% position:39% line:92%
-Oh, all right, okay.

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:57.777 align:start size:94% position:6%
Tell us, please,
what do you have to say

00:02:57.777 --> 00:03:00.046 align:start size:94% position:6%
about President Trump
endorsing you,

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:01.848 line:92%
in light of all the allegations?

00:03:01.848 --> 00:03:02.515 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Well, I'm shocked.

00:03:02.515 --> 00:03:06.252 align:start size:94% position:6%
These are some serious
and disturbing allegations

00:03:06.252 --> 00:03:07.987 align:start size:94% position:6%
against Donald Trump,
and, frankly,

00:03:07.987 --> 00:03:11.257 align:start size:94% position:6%
I do not want to be associated
with this fella at all.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:12.091 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No, wait, wait.
I'm sorry, wait.

00:03:12.091 --> 00:03:14.827 align:start size:94% position:6%
You don't want
to be associated with him?

00:03:14.827 --> 00:03:15.395 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Hell no!

00:03:15.395 --> 00:03:17.430 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's why
I'm rejecting his endorsement.

00:03:17.430 --> 00:03:21.634 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think that he is a --
he's immature, he's annoying,

00:03:21.634 --> 00:03:25.371 align:start size:94% position:6%
he's gossipy, he's like a --
he's like a teenage girl,

00:03:25.371 --> 00:03:26.873 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
but in a bad way.

00:03:26.873 --> 00:03:31.010 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:03:31.010 --> 00:03:31.544 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-All right.

00:03:31.544 --> 00:03:34.147
I-I-I'm not sure how much longer
I want to talk to you here.

00:03:34.147 --> 00:03:37.350 size:84% position:42%
-Well, come on, I mean,
look at my cowboy hat.

00:03:37.350 --> 00:03:38.017 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, I know.

00:03:38.017 --> 00:03:40.753 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm like Billy the...Kid
molester.

00:03:40.753 --> 00:03:41.287 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:03:41.287 --> 00:03:42.622 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hey, look,
I think that's enough.

00:03:42.622 --> 00:03:43.990 align:start size:94% position:6%
That's enough, I think,
from you.

00:03:43.990 --> 00:03:45.291 line:92%
-Let me just run real quick --

00:03:45.291 --> 00:03:47.493 size:88% position:44%
Let me run a couple of
campaign slogans by you.

00:03:47.493 --> 00:03:48.394 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
What do you think?

00:03:48.394 --> 00:03:49.229 line:92%
-Okay, fine, fine, go ahead.

00:03:49.229 --> 00:03:51.231 size:84% position:42%
-All right, here we go.
All right, first one.

00:03:51.231 --> 00:03:52.665 align:start size:94% position:6%
Roy Moore --
I dress like this

00:03:52.665 --> 00:03:55.001 align:start size:94% position:6%
'cause I can't go to the mall
to get new clothes.

00:03:55.001 --> 00:03:57.470 align:start size:94% position:6%
-All right, okay.
Okay. Okay, that's --

00:03:57.470 --> 00:03:59.739 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Hang on, now.
Next one is even better.

00:03:59.739 --> 00:04:01.874 line:92%
Roy Moore -- Don't Google me!

00:04:01.874 --> 00:04:04.310 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Okay, that's your slogan --
that's your slogan?

00:04:04.310 --> 00:04:06.446 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And, finally,
let me wrap it up here, ready?

00:04:06.446 --> 00:04:10.316 align:start size:94% position:6%
Roy Moore -- if 2017
was a person, it'd be me.

00:04:10.316 --> 00:04:12.652 align:start size:94% position:6%
-There you go, that is enough.
Can we cut his feed?

00:04:12.652 --> 00:04:13.353 line:92%
Cut his feed right there.

00:04:13.353 --> 00:04:14.387 align:start size:94% position:6%
-See you at the food court,
Jimmy!

00:04:14.387 --> 00:04:16.756
-All right, thank you very much.
Cut his feed there.

00:04:16.756 --> 00:04:18.057 size:78% position:39% line:92%
Roy Moore, everybody.

00:04:18.057 --> 00:04:19.759 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:19.759 --> 00:04:21.494 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
Roy Moore.

00:04:21.494 --> 00:04:24.831 align:start size:94% position:6%
-We cut his feed.
-Cut that feed!

00:04:24.831 --> 00:04:27.200 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:04:27.200 --> 00:04:27.867 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-This is very nice here.

00:04:27.867 --> 00:04:31.337
I read about a 22-year-old man
who met an 81-year-old woman

00:04:31.337 --> 00:04:33.673 align:start size:94% position:6%
who he's been playing
"Words with Friends" with

00:04:33.673 --> 00:04:34.807 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
for over a year.

00:04:34.807 --> 00:04:36.476 align:start size:94% position:6%
The woman called it
a lovely experience,

00:04:36.476 --> 00:04:37.143 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
while the man said,

00:04:37.143 --> 00:04:39.612 align:start size:94% position:6%
"I just got catfished
by an 81-year-old. Wow!"

00:04:39.612 --> 00:04:43.116 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:04:43.116 --> 00:04:44.217 line:92%
A little sports news here.

00:04:44.217 --> 00:04:46.319 align:start size:94% position:6%
After going
2 and 10 this season,

00:04:46.319 --> 00:04:48.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
the Giants have fired
coach Ben McAdoo

00:04:48.955 --> 00:04:51.024 line:92%
and General Manager Jerry Reese.

00:04:51.024 --> 00:04:53.593 size:84% position:42% line:92%
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:53.593 --> 00:04:56.229 align:start size:94% position:6%
Well, if you're wondering what
happened to Ben and Jerry,

00:04:56.229 --> 00:04:57.330 line:92%
they're probably on the couch

00:04:57.330 --> 00:04:59.198 align:start size:94% position:6%
eating some Ben &amp; Jerry's
right now.

00:04:59.198 --> 00:05:03.369 line:92%
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:05:03.369 --> 00:05:05.872 size:88% position:44%
And, finally, you guys,
a woman in Virginia says

00:05:05.872 --> 00:05:08.174
that she found a million-dollar
winning lottery ticket

00:05:08.174 --> 00:05:10.343 line:92%
in her husband's backpack.

00:05:10.343 --> 00:05:12.679
She said it almost makes up
for the fact that she's married

00:05:12.679 --> 00:05:14.547 align:start size:94% position:6%
to a grown man
who still wears a backpack.

00:05:14.547 --> 00:05:18.551 align:start size:94% position:6%
We have a great show tonight!
Give it up for The Roots!

